atifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8.png 1376w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-300x167.png 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-1024x572.png 1024w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-768x429.png 768w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-600x335.png 600w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-150x84.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1376px) 100vw, 1376px\" />					\n								<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8.png 1376w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-300x167.png 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-1024x572.png 1024w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-768x429.png 768w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-600x335.png 600w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-150x84.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1376px) 100vw, 1376px\" />					\n					<h2>زیبایی، انتخاب دقیق می‌خواهد.</h2>					<p data-interaction-id=\"2f9bdb9\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"2f9bdb9\">سال‌ها تجربه در دنیای زیبایی به ما یاد داده که هر محصولی برای همه مناسب نیست. اینجا تلاش کرده‌ایم مجموعه‌ای از محصولات آرایشی و مراقبتی را با دقت انتخاب کنیم؛ محصولاتی که کیفیت، اصالت و اثربخشی‌شان برای ما اولویت بوده است.</p>\n					<p data-interaction-id=\"edc9c85\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"edc9c85\">اگر بین انتخاب‌ها مردد هستید، با خیال راحت از ما مشاوره بگیرید؛ چون باور داریم خرید خوب، از انتخاب درست شروع می‌شود.</p>\n								<img  src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image-14.svg\" title=\"image ۱۴\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">					\n					<p>مشاوره در واتس آپ</p>				\n			<p>یا تماس با: ۰۹۱۷۰۱۳۹۷۲۹</p>\n<style>\n.beauty-wrapper{\n    width:100%;\n}\n/* =========================\n   DESKTOP (همون قبلی)\n========================= */\n.beauty-panels{\n    display:flex;\n    gap:18px;\n    width:100%;\n    height:620px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n}\n.beauty-panel{\n    position:relative;\n    flex:0 0 120px;\n    border-radius:24px;\n    cursor:pointer;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    background-size:cover;\n    background-position:center;\n    transition:\n        flex .85s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),\n        transform .5s ease;\n    will-change:flex, transform;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;\n}\n.beauty-panel.active{\n    flex:1;\n}\n.beauty-panel:hover{\n    transform:translateY(-3px);\n}\n.beauty-panel::before{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    inset:0;\n    background:inherit;\n    background-size:cover;\n    background-position:center;\n    transition:transform 1s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);\n    will-change:transform;\n}\n.beauty-panel:hover::before{\n    transform:scale(1.06);\n}\n.beauty-panel::after{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    inset:0;\n    z-index:1;\n    transition:opacity .4s ease;\n}\n.beauty-panel:not(.active)::after{\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,.28);\n    opacity:1;\n}\n.beauty-panel.active::after{\n    background:transparent;\n    opacity:0;\n}\n.beauty-dots{\n    display:none;\n}\n/* =========================\n   MOBILE SLIDER\n========================= */\n@media (max-width:767px){\n    .beauty-panels{\n        display:flex;\n        flex-direction:row;\n        overflow-x:auto;\n        overflow-y:hidden;\n        height:auto;\n        gap:14px;\n        padding-bottom:8px;\n        scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n        -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\n        scrollbar-width:none;\n    }\n    .beauty-panels::-webkit-scrollbar{\n        display:none;\n    }\n    .beauty-panel{\n        flex:0 0 88%;\n        width:88%;\n        height:380px;\n        min-width:88%;\n        border-radius:24px;\n        scroll-snap-align:center;\n        transform:none !important;\n    }\n    .beauty-panel::before{\n        transform:none !important;\n    }\n    .beauty-panel::after{\n        background:transparent !important;\n        opacity:0 !important;\n    }\n    .beauty-panel.active{\n        flex:0 0 88%;\n    }\n    .beauty-dots{\n        display:flex;\n        justify-content:center;\n        gap:8px;\n        margin-top:16px;\n    }\n    .beauty-dot{\n        width:8px;\n        height:8px;\n        border-radius:50%;\n        background:#d5d5d5;\n        transition:.3s ease;\n    }\n    .beauty-dot.active{\n        transform:scale(1.3);\n        background:#111;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n					<button onclick=\"beautyUIOpenAuth()\">Test Login</button>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','57-revision-v1','','','2026-07-02 13:14:57','2026-07-02 13:14:57','',57,'https://arayeshilatifi.ir/?p=431',0,'revision','',0),(433,1,'2026-07-05 10:29:46','2026-07-05 10:29:46','','Liana-FD-VF','','inherit','open','closed','','liana-fd-vf','','','2026-07-05 10:29:46','2026-07-05 10:29:46','',0,'https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Liana-FD-VF.ttf',0,'attachment','font/ttf',0),(435,1,'2026-07-05 10:32:55','2026-07-05 10:32:55','html,\nbody {\n    direction: rtl !important;\n    text-align: right;\n}\n\n\nbody {\n    unicode-bidi: embed;\n}\n@font-face {\n  font-family: \'LianaFD\';\n  src: url(\'https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Liana-FD-VF.ttf\') format(\'truetype\');\n  font-weight: 100 900;\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-display: swap;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: \'LianaFD\', sans-serif !important;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody,\nbutton,\ninput,\ntextarea,\nselect,\n.elementor-widget,\n.elementor-heading-title,\n.wd-nav,\n.whb-header,\n.wd-header,\n.woocommerce,\n.woocommerce *,\n.wd-products,\n.wd-product,\n.product,\nbutton,\na {\n  font-family: \'LianaFD\', sans-serif !important;\n\n}\n\n/* =========================\n   BEAUTY CART DRAWER\n========================= */\n\n.cart-widget-side{\n    width:420px !important;\n    max-width:92vw;\n    background:#fff !important;\n    box-shadow:none !important;\n    border-left:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n    border-radius:0 !important;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    z-index:999999 !important;\n}\n\n/* HEADER */\n.cart-widget-side .wd-heading{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    padding:26px 24px 18px;\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n    background:#fff;\n}\n\n.cart-widget-side .wd-heading .title{\n    font-size:22px;\n    font-weight:800;\n    color:#111;\n    font-family:inherit;\n}\n\n/* CLOSE BTN */\n.cart-widget-side .close-side-widget a{\n    width:42px;\n    height:42px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    display:flex !important;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    background:#f7f7f7;\n    transition:.25s ease;\n}\n\n.cart-widget-side .close-side-widget a:hover{\n    background:#efefef;\n    transform:rotate(90deg);\n}\n\n.cart-widget-side .wd-action-text{\n    display:none;\n}\n\n/* PRODUCTS WRAPPER */\n.widget_shopping_cart_content{\n    padding:10px 22px 22px;\n}\n\n/* PRODUCT ITEM */\n.elementor-menu-cart__product{\n    display:grid !important;\n    grid-template-columns:82px 1fr auto;\n    gap:14px;\n    align-items:center;\n    padding:18px 0;\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n}\n\n/* PRODUCT IMAGE */\n.elementor-menu-cart__product-image img{\n    width:82px !important;\n    height:82px !important;\n    object-fit:cover;\n    border-radius:20px;\n    background:#f8f8f8;\n    transition:transform .45s ease;\n}\n\n.elementor-menu-cart__product:hover img{\n    transform:scale(1.04);\n}\n\n/* TITLE */\n.elementor-menu-cart__product-name a{\n    display:block;\n    font-size:15px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    line-height:1.9;\n    color:#111;\n    text-decoration:none;\n    transition:opacity .25s ease;\n}\n\n.elementor-menu-cart__product-name a:hover{\n    opacity:.72;\n}\n\n/* PRICE */\n.elementor-menu-cart__product-price{\n    margin-top:8px;\n    font-size:14px;\n    font-weight:600;\n    color:#666;\n}\n\n.elementor-menu-cart__product-price .amount{\n    color:#111;\n    font-weight:700;\n}\n\n/* REMOVE BTN */\n.elementor-menu-cart__product-remove{\n    align-self:flex-start;\n}\n\n.elementor-menu-cart__product-remove a{\n    width:34px;\n    height:34px;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    background:#f7f7f7;\n    display:flex !important;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-decoration:none;\n    transition:.25s ease;\n}\n\n.elementor-menu-cart__product-remove a:hover{\n    background:#111;\n    color:#fff !important;\n}\n\n/* SUBTOTAL */\n.elementor-menu-cart__subtotal{\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    align-items:center;\n    margin-top:22px;\n    padding-top:22px;\n    border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n    font-size:15px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    color:#111;\n}\n\n/* FOOTER BUTTONS */\n.elementor-menu-cart__footer-buttons{\n    display:grid;\n    gap:12px;\n    margin-top:22px;\n}\n\n/* BUTTONS */\n.elementor-menu-cart__footer-buttons .elementor-button{\n    width:100%;\n    min-height:54px;\n    border-radius:18px !important;\n    border:none !important;\n    font-size:14px;\n    font-weight:700;\n    transition:.28s ease;\n}\n\n/* VIEW CART */\n.elementor-button--view-cart{\n    background:#f6f6f6 !important;\n    color:#111 !important;\n}\n\n.elementor-button--view-cart:hover{\n    background:#ededed !important;\n}\n\n/* CHECKOUT */\n.elementor-button--checkout{\n    background:#111 !important;\n    color:#fff !important;\n}\n\n.elementor-button--checkout:hover{\n    transform:translateY(-2px);\n    opacity:.92;\n}\n\n/* MOBILE */\n@media(max-width:767px){\n\n    .cart-widget-side{\n        width:100vw !important;\n        max-width:100vw !important;\n        border-radius:24px 24px 0 0 !important;\n    }\n\n    .cart-widget-side .wd-heading{\n        padding:22px 18px 16px;\n    }\n\n    .elementor-menu-cart__product{\n        grid-template-columns:72px 1fr auto;\n        gap:12px;\n        padding:16px 0;\n    }\n\n    .elementor-menu-cart__product-image img{\n        width:72px !important;\n        height:72px !important;\n        border-radius:16px;\n    }\n\n    .elementor-menu-cart__product-name a{\n        font-size:14px;\n    }\n\n    .elementor-menu-cart__footer-buttons .elementor-button{\n        min-height:50px;\n        border-radius:16px !important;\n    }\n}\n\n\n\n#main-header{\n    position:fixed;\n    top:0;\n    left:0;\n    right:0;\n    z-index:99999;\n\n    background:#fff;\n\n    transform:translateY(-100%);\n    transition:\n        transform .35s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),\n        box-shadow .3s ease;\n}\n\n#main-header.is-sticky{\n    transform:translateY(0);\n    box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n}\n\nbody{\n    padding-top:90px;\n}\n\n/* =========================\n   Fixed Header Offset\n   ========================= */\n\n/* دسکتاپ / تبلت */\nbody {\n    padding-top: 180px !important;\n}\n\n/* تبلت */\n@media (max-width: 991px) {\n    body {\n        padding-top: 145px !important;\n    }\n}\n\n/* موبایل */\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    body {\n        padding-top: 105px !important;\n    }\n}','woodmart-child','','inherit','closed','closed','','119-revision-v1','','','2026-07-05 10:32:55','2026-07-05 10:32:55','',119,'https://arayeshilatifi.ir/?p=435',0,'