			<img  src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/call-calling.svg\" title=\"call-calling\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3000\" height=\"3000\">					\n			<p>مشاوره قبل از خرید</p>\n								<img  src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/shop.svg\" title=\"shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3000\" height=\"3000\">					\n			<p>خرید آنلاین و حضوری</p>\n								<img  src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/verify.svg\" title=\"verify\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3000\" height=\"3000\">					\n			<p>ضمانت اصالت کالا</p>\n								<img  src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/truck-fast.svg\" title=\"truck-fast\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3000\" height=\"3000\">					\n			<p>ارسال به سراسر کشور</p>\n					<h2>دسته بندیــــــ  محصولات</h2>				\n								<img width=\"646\" height=\"645\" src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858.webp\" alt=\"محصولات مراقبت پوستی در آرایشی لطیفی\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858.webp 646w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858-300x300.webp 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858-150x150.webp 150w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858-600x599.webp 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 646px) 100vw, 646px\" />					\n								<img width=\"215\" height=\"215\" src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-215x215.webp\" alt=\"محصولات مراقبت مو در آرایشی لطیفی\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-215x215.webp 215w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-300x300.webp 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-150x150.webp 150w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-600x599.webp 600w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859.web