ent/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858.webp 646w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858-300x300.webp 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858-150x150.webp 150w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-858-600x599.webp 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 646px) 100vw, 646px\" />					\n								<img width=\"215\" height=\"215\" src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-215x215.webp\" alt=\"محصولات مراقبت مو در آرایشی لطیفی\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-215x215.webp 215w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-300x300.webp 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-150x150.webp 150w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859-600x599.webp 600w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-859.webp 646w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\" />					\n								<img width=\"215\" height=\"215\" src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-860-215x215.webp\" alt=\"محصولات آرایشی در آرایشی لطیفی\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-860-215x215.webp 215w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-860-300x300.webp 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-860-150x150.webp 150w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-860-600x599.webp 600w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-860.webp 646w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\" />					\n								<img width=\"215\" height=\"215\" src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-861-215x215.webp\" alt=\"محصولات مراقبت بدن در ارایشی لطیفی\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-861-215x215.webp 215w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-861-300x300.webp 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-861-150x150.webp 150w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-861-600x599.webp 600w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-861.webp 646w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\" />					\n								<img width=\"215\" height=\"215\" src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-856-215x215.webp\" alt=\"محصولات اقایان در ارایشی لطیفی\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-856-215x215.webp 215w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-856-300x300.webp 300w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-856-150x150.webp 150w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-856-600x599.webp 600w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Frame-856.webp 646w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\" />					\n					<h2>محبوب ترینـــــ  انتخاب ها</h2>				\n			<p>محصولاتی که بیشترین رضایت و خرید را از مشتریان ما داشته‌اند</p>\n			<p>مشاهده همه محصولات</p>\n								<img  src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Icons-1.svg\" title=\"Icons\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3000\" height=\"3000\">					\n		[beauty_product_loop limit=\"8\" columns=\"4\"]		\n			<p>مشاهده همه محصولات</p>\n								<img  src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Icons-1.svg\" title=\"Icons\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"3000\" height=\"3000\">					\n								<img width=\"1376\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8.png 1376w, https://arayeshilatifi.ir/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Gemini_Generated_Image_ags8e6ags8e6ags8-300x167.png 300w, https